// Service_Observability — Observability Layer (layanan, tanpa alat)
// Render manual: https://app.eraser.io > Diagram-as-code (cloud architecture).
//   Buat kanvas BARU bernama "Service_Observability".
// Ekspor PNG ke materials/reports/figures/Service_Observability.png
// Acuan: fig:service-observability (Subbab IV.2.3, subsec:rincian-kelompok);
//   rincian bebas-tool kelompok baris 7 Tabel layanan_industri, komponen verbatim.
// Sumber edge: kreuzberger2023mlops (monitoring component), amershi2019software
//   (model monitoring pada tahap produksi), munappy2020adhoc (data monitoring
//   berkelanjutan), googlecloud2024mlops (pemantauan memicu retraining otomatis
//   pada level 2).
// Ikon generik (bebas-tool), nama diverifikasi docs.eraser.io/docs/icons 2026-07-11.
// Rendering WAJIB horizontal (direction right), tanpa \rotatebox pada LaTeX.

direction right

// Penghasil sinyal (batas)
Model Lifecycle Layer [icon: refresh-cw, color: purple, label: "Model Lifecycle Layer"]
Data Ingestion and Processing Layer [icon: download, color: orange, label: "Data Ingestion and Processing Layer"]

Observability Layer [icon: eye, color: teal] {
  model monitoring [icon: activity]
  data monitoring [icon: eye]
  monitoring component [icon: monitor]
}

// Sinyal masuk (amershi2019software, munappy2020adhoc)
Model Lifecycle Layer > model monitoring: kinerja model produksi
Data Ingestion and Processing Layer > data monitoring: kesehatan pipeline data

// Konsolidasi dan umpan balik (kreuzberger2023mlops, googlecloud2024mlops)
model monitoring > monitoring component: konsolidasi sinyal
data monitoring > monitoring component: konsolidasi sinyal
monitoring component > Model Lifecycle Layer: pemicu retraining otomatis
